{%- comment -%}
  NON-PAGINATED LOOP TEST
  - Directly loops over blog.articles
  - Prints each as JSON
  - Bypasses any weird pagination or placeholders
{%- endcomment -%}

<h2>Non-Paginated Loop Test 2</h2>
<p>blog.handle: {{ blog.handle }}</p>
<p>blog.articles_count: {{ blog.articles_count }}</p>

{% if blog.articles.size == 0 %}
  <p>No articles found in blog.articles</p>
{% else %}
  <p>Looping over blog.articles directly ({{ blog.articles.size }} articles):</p>
  <div style="background:#eaf2ff; padding:10px;">
    {% for a in blog.articles %}
      <pre style="margin-bottom:1rem; border:1px dashed #aaa; padding:10px; white-space:pre-wrap;">
        {{ a | json }}
      </pre>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
{% endif %}
